{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the third side of the triangle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. By the triangle inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be strictly less than the sum of the other two sides, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b777560b5c61867ab18d54c8349e404bb5ffb22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 20 + 26 = 46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />. The maximum possible integer value for the perimeter occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is at its maximum possible value. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd9abd1b842ac2bf096a1ce9b76dde29edce1f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, the upper bound for the perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/8411d138dddc1cfc255847a03c04fc891b2ede21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 + 26 + 46 = 92$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />. Because the side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be strictly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abef9fdb0235b2ede2639538b5bd76711e058fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, the perimeter must be strictly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/403d424cf0f48517174037a871a71d9c35f1796e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$92$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The largest integer perimeter less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/403d424cf0f48517174037a871a71d9c35f1796e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$92$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/9/139e365e36591e1c2c9cf84c89fdf0110e142334.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 91}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also_2\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034416\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2123/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37391:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034416 and revision id 291911. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}